  "Wawancara": "Interviews",
  "Panduan Interview Kerja": "Job Interview Guide",
  "Persiapan sebelum, saat, dan sesudah wawancara": "Preparation before, during, and after an interview",
  "Diperbarui 10 Mei 2025": "Updated May 10, 2025",
  "Panduan menghadapi wawancara kerja pertama, disusun dari pertanyaan yang paling sering muncul pada perekrutan tingkat pemula di bidang teknologi.": "A guide to your first job interview, based on questions commonly asked when recruiting entry-level technology candidates.",
  "Sebelum hari wawancara, pelajari apa yang dikerjakan perusahaan dan siapkan satu pertanyaan yang menunjukkan Anda benar-benar mencari tahu. Pertanyaan yang baik memberi kesan lebih kuat daripada jawaban yang dihafal.": "Before the interview, learn what the company does and prepare a question that shows you have researched it. A thoughtful question makes a stronger impression than a memorized answer.",
  "Saat wawancara, jawab pertanyaan pengalaman dengan urutan situasi, tindakan, dan hasil. Bila belum punya pengalaman kerja, proyek sekolah tetap sah dijadikan contoh selama diceritakan dengan jujur.": "In the interview, answer experience questions by describing the situation, action, and result. If you have no work experience, school projects are valid examples when described honestly.",
  "Setelah selesai, kirim pesan terima kasih singkat dalam satu hari kerja. Langkah kecil ini jarang dilakukan pelamar lain dan membuat Anda lebih diingat.": "Afterward, send a short thank-you message within one working day. Few applicants take this small step, and it helps the interviewer remember you.",
  "Isi": "Contents",
  "Daftar pertanyaan dan cara menjawab": "Questions and how to answer them",
  "Sesi latihan": "Practice sessions",
  "Tersedia lewat BKK sekolah": "Available through the school BKK",
  "Tes Seleksi": "Selection Tests",
  "Latihan Soal dan Tips": "Practice Questions and Tips",
  "Kumpulan soal tes masuk kerja": "Job selection test practice questions",
  "Diperbarui 6 Mei 2025": "Updated May 6, 2025",
  "Kumpulan soal latihan untuk tahap tes tertulis, mencakup kemampuan dasar, logika, dan pengetahuan teknis sesuai bidang keahlian.": "Practice questions for written selection tests, covering basic skills, logic, and technical knowledge relevant to your field.",
  "Bagian kemampuan dasar menguji hitungan cepat dan pemahaman bacaan. Kuncinya bukan menghafal rumus, melainkan membiasakan diri mengerjakan dengan batas waktu.": "The basic skills section tests quick calculation and reading comprehension. The key is to practice working within a time limit, rather than memorizing formulas.",
  "Bagian logika berisi pola gambar dan penalaran. Latihan rutin membuat pola-pola yang muncul terasa akrab sehingga waktu pengerjaan jauh lebih hemat.": "The logic section covers visual patterns and reasoning. Regular practice makes recurring patterns familiar and saves time.",
  "Bagian teknis disesuaikan dengan jurusan. Kerjakan soal sesuai bidang Anda dulu, baru melebar ke bidang lain jika masih ada waktu.": "The technical section is tailored to your study program. Start with questions in your field, then explore others if time remains.",
  "Jumlah soal": "Number of questions",
  "Lebih dari 200 butir": "More than 200 questions",
  "Pembahasan": "Explanations",
  "Disertakan di setiap paket": "Included in every package",
